        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "BardQ",
        "name": "Cosmic Binding",
        "summary": "Bard fires a missile which will slow the first enemy struck, and continue onward. If it strikes a wall, it will stun the initial target; if it strikes another enemy, it will stun them both.",
        "bodyHtml": "Bard fires an energy bolt, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the first two enemies hit. The first target hit is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 60% for 1/1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8s.<br /><br />If the bolt hits a second enemy or a wall, any enemies hit are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 1/1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8s.<br />",
