        "slot": "W",
        "id": "BardW",
        "name": "Caretaker's Shrine",
        "summary": "Reveals a Health shrine which powers up over a short time, disappearing after healing and speeding up the first ally that touches it.",
        "bodyHtml": "Bard creates a Health shrine that grants <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(20/22.5/25/27.5/30% + (0.06% Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> decaying over 1.5 seconds and restores at least <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(25/50/75/100/125 + (40% Ability Power)) Health</span> to the first ally to enter. The shrine grows to restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(50/87.5/125/162.5/200 + (70% Ability Power)) Health</span> after existing for 5 seconds.<br /><br />Bard can have up to 3 shrines at once. If an enemy champion enters a shrine, it is destroyed.<br /><br />This ability has 2 charges.<br /><br />Current Active Shrines: /",
